Patches to wasix-libc, pinned in ../default.nix and built by toolchain/libc.sh
with mimalloc as its allocator (enabled by patch 0003).

Except where otherwise noted, Copyright (c) 2026 Ethan Jones.

0001-chdir-lock-relative-path-resolution.patch is wasi-libc commit
aa9b5c0820fc (https://github.com/WebAssembly/wasi-libc/pull/781, by CPunisher)
applied to wasix-libc's copy of the file; it remains the copyright of its
author.

0004-setjmp-define-the-c-longjmp-tag.patch is the part of wasi-libc commit
2fc32bc81b9f (https://github.com/WebAssembly/wasi-libc/pull/772, by
alexcrichton) that defines the __c_longjmp tag, applied to wasix-libc's copy
of the setjmp/longjmp runtime; it remains the copyright of its author.

