with the LLVM exception (LICENSE-Apache-2.0-WITH-LLVM-exception), the Apache
License 2.0 (LICENSE-Apache-2.0) or the MIT License (LICENSE-MIT), at your
option; everything in this series is offered under the same three. The files
the series modifies carry the change notice Apache-2.0 requires.

Context lines are from upstream and remain the copyright of their authors
under upstream's terms.
